From 9aef1045ecee803bc3d1a3e12df99421d8a1b24e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yooz <136268860+y-o-o-z@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 17:32:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] local: erssi journal - history gaps and erssi-only
 windows from webjournal.pl

webjournal.pl (y-o-o-z/irssi_scripts) writes every erssi window to
~/.erssi/journal. On init Nexus stores the journal entries its storage is
missing (Nexus restarts no longer leave holes), shows the network status
window in the lobby and adds an 'erssi' group with the windows fe-web does
not carry (Notices, Mentions, script windows), followed live.

Also: theme time column sized for Geist Mono, theme CSS in the cache-bust.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
